## Interface: 16001
## Title: RealUI Forever Beta Bootstrap
## Category: RealUI_Core
## Notes: WoW Forever beta only: skips the RealUI install wizard at every login, because the beta does not keep addon settings. Delete this addon once it does.
## Version: 4.0.2
## IconTexture: Interface\AddOns\RealUI\Media\Icon
## RequiredDeps: RealUI

# Profile.lua is yours: copy Profile.example.lua to Profile.lua and fill it in.
# It is not in the zip, so updating this addon never overwrites it. Without it
# the bootstrap completes the install with RealUI's stock settings.
Profile.lua
Bootstrap.lua
